{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Levi-Civita 联络"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Levi-Civita 联络”"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Riemann 流形的切丛上存在唯一的联络 $\\nabla$, 满足</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\nabla g = 0$ (度量相容性);</li>\n<li>$\\nabla_X Y - \\nabla_Y X - [X,Y]=0$ (无"},{"Local":{"url":"挠","text":"挠率"}},{"Plain":", torsion-free).</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}